3.5px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;text-decoration:none}\n.shopguide .add-to-cart:hover{background:#000}\n</style>\n<div class=\"shopguide\">\n<article class=\"article\">\n<div class=\"kicker\">Guides &amp; advice · Choosing silk</div>\n<h1>Solid or printed. Which one will you actually wear?</h1>\n<p class=\"byline\">The ASYII Team</p>\n<p class=\"toc\"><a href=\"#first-one\">1. The short answer and which one to start with</a></p>\n<p class=\"lead\">If you are buying one silk square and you want to wear it, start with a <b>print that repeats a colour you already own</b> — not a plain one. A solid is the safest thing on a shelf. A print with one familiar colour is the safest thing in a drawer.</p>\n<p class=\"lead\">The right answer changes depending on what you are deciding. Find your situation below.</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-one\">You are buying your first one</h2>\n<p>A silk square is easy to love and surprisingly easy to leave in a drawer. The ones that get worn are the ones that had a job from the start — a colour to repeat, or a small way to test the idea.</p><p>Start cheap, or start with a print that already belongs to your wardrobe.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">{% assign prod = all_products['printed-floral-devore-silk-twilly'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=printed-floral-devore-silk-twilly' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed floral devore silk twilly\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Printed · silk twilly</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed floral devore silk twilly</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want to find out whether you like silk at all before spending more.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<button class=\"add-to-cart\" data-variant-id=\"{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\" data-utm-campaign=\"solid-or-printed-silk-scarf\" data-utm-content=\"printed-floral-devore-silk-twilly\">Add to cart</button>\n</div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['printed-abstract-floral-silk-twill-square'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=printed-abstract-floral-silk-twill-square' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed abstract floral silk twill square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Printed · silk twill</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed abstract floral silk twill square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> Your wardrobe already has one of its colours — it will match more than you expect.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<button class=\"add-to-cart\" data-variant-id=\"{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\" data-utm-campaign=\"solid-or-printed-silk-scarf\" data-utm-content=\"printed-abstract-floral-silk-twill-square\">Add to cart</button>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/collections/little-silk\" target=\"_blank\">little silk</a> · <a href=\"/collections/signature-silk\" target=\"_blank\">signature squares</a></p><h2 id=\"quiet-wardrobe\">Your wardrobe is mostly quiet colours</h2>\n<p>This is where the solid-versus-print question usually lands. A printed square with a soft colour in it behaves like a neutral — it adds something without competing.</p><p>A true solid is safest of all, but it asks you to build the outfit around it. Neither of these is a statement piece. That is deliberate.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">{% assign prod = all_products['printed-floral-silk-twill-square-mint'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=printed-floral-silk-twill-square-mint' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed floral silk twill square — Mint\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Mint · silk twill</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed floral silk twill square — Mint</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> Your wardrobe is mostly cream, grey or navy and you want colour that behaves like a neutral.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<button class=\"add-to-cart\" data-variant-id=\"{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\" data-utm-campaign=\"solid-or-printed-silk-scarf\" data-utm-content=\"printed-floral-silk-twill-square-mint\">Add to cart</button>\n</div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['printed-floral-silk-twill-square-yellow-butter'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=printed-floral-silk-twill-square-yellow-butter' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed floral silk twill square — Butter Yellow\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Butter yellow · silk twill</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed floral silk twill square — Butter Yellow</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want one accent that lifts a plain outfit without asking for attention.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<button class=\"add-to-cart\" data-variant-id=\"{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\" data-utm-campaign=\"solid-or-printed-silk-scarf\" data-utm-content=\"printed-floral-silk-twill-square-yellow-butter\">Add to cart</button>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/collections/everyday-silk\" target=\"_blank\">everyday silk</a> · <a href=\"/blogs/asyii-diaries/how-to-choose-a-scarf-print-and-colour-youll-actually-wear\" target=\"_blank\">how to choose a print</a></p><h2 id=\"gift\">It is a gift and you do not know her exact taste</h2>\n<p>This is the most common reason a scarf goes unworn: you guessed the colour, the size, or the way she dresses.</p><p>The safe move is not a safer colour — it is a piece with less to get wrong. Smaller scale, one size, no guesswork. Both are hand-finished and boxed, so the answer still feels like a gift.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">{% assign prod = all_products['bloom-corner-45cm-hand-rolled-silk-twill-scarf-with-double-face-printed'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=bloom-corner-45cm-hand-rolled-silk-twill-scarf-with-double-face-printed' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Bloom Corner 45cm hand-rolled silk square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Floral · 45cm</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bloom Corner 45cm hand-rolled silk square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You are buying for someone and don’t know her size, her scarf style or her colour preferences.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<button class=\"add-to-cart\" data-variant-id=\"{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\" data-utm-campaign=\"solid-or-printed-silk-scarf\" data-utm-content=\"bloom-corner-45cm-hand-rolled-silk-twill-scarf-with-double-face-printed\">Add to cart</button>\n</div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['gift-to-self-silk-wool-square-scarf-limited-edition'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=solid-or-printed-silk-scarf&utm_content=gift-to-self-silk-wo